{"name": "Tiles of War", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tiles of War is a turn-based strategy / tactics game, where you can capture every territory.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by timeless classics, Tiles of War takes tactics games to the next level by letting you capture all territories on the map!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick a side and use your units wisely to dominate the map, leading your faction to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Battle!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Strategise and make the best move possible to wipe out your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/2a282c8f97fb34e511d480b8c7688b66.poster.avif?t=1787594456\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/2a282c8f97fb34e511d480b8c7688b66.webm?t=1787594456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/2a282c8f97fb34e511d480b8c7688b66.mp4?t=1787594456\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br/><strong>Commanders</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each of the 18 commanders comes with a truly unique passive, small and big abilities.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"368\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/e19332e11726e326749e803c419677f1.poster.avif?t=1787594456\" width=\"784\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/e19332e11726e326749e803c419677f1.webm?t=1787594456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/e19332e11726e326749e803c419677f1.mp4?t=1787594456\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Capture territories</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The entire map can be captured. Infantry can secure more territory by surrounding tiles, though enemy infantry can interrupt the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/cabf8d92bf4ffcbb8c80405f17f4a99d.poster.avif?t=1787594456\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/cabf8d92bf4ffcbb8c80405f17f4a99d.webm?t=1787594456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/cabf8d92bf4ffcbb8c80405f17f4a99d.mp4?t=1787594456\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Campaign</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each faction has its own campaign to uncover what happens between the Humans, Undead, and Elves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/bb1503c3f150f19d58e91fcfc2f486d6.poster.avif?t=1787594456\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/bb1503c3f150f19d58e91fcfc2f486d6.webm?t=1787594456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/bb1503c3f150f19d58e91fcfc2f486d6.mp4?t=1787594456\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Skirmish</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A variety of settings to customise your battles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/9ff19e0867c7f9e3891b267a64884bd1.poster.avif?t=1787594456\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/9ff19e0867c7f9e3891b267a64884bd1.webm?t=1787594456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/9ff19e0867c7f9e3891b267a64884bd1.mp4?t=1787594456\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Map generation, Custom maps, Fog of War, Etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>(Competitive) Multiplayer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight the best of the best for a position on the global ranking system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/862cfd1c091352ef123127b4ea430cbd.poster.avif?t=1787594456\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/862cfd1c091352ef123127b4ea430cbd.webm?t=1787594456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/862cfd1c091352ef123127b4ea430cbd.mp4?t=1787594456\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Map and Scenario editor</strong><br/>Create custom maps\u00a0and stories in our Map Editor </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/e6408d792cc44aeb5a9c7d14d5ac2d33.poster.avif?t=1787594456\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/e6408d792cc44aeb5a9c7d14d5ac2d33.webm?t=1787594456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/e6408d792cc44aeb5a9c7d14d5ac2d33.mp4?t=1787594456\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A turn-based tactics game, where every tile can be captured to become part of your territories. More territories, more money, better troops. Finish the three campaigns or become number one in competitive multiplayer with an Elo ranking system! Don\u2019t worry, there is also a skirmish mode.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/e3e1c8c45edabce32af532c56e2adaa487b9c4a5/header.jpg?t=1787594456", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Wargame", "Turn-Based Tactics", "Pixel Graphics", "Military", "PvP", "Fantasy"], "developers": "NotJustGames", "publishers": "NotJustGames", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2354240", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "22 March 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Fnjb4WrtHlA", "first_seen": 1774134000.0, "review_rank": 964}